Excalibur from a bones pile, a spiked pit, some wand, etc). Otherwise, 
I'd start fighting, and levelling. I did that once, and it went pretty 
fast. That character left minetown with AC -8 and 60 hitpoints, and got 
to the castle where he was drowned.

> I'd really like to hear from some protection-racketeers about what
