I think an extra 9 AC is a great boost, especially if you start fighting 
afterwards, and go up again, to Sokoban, since that gives you more HP, 
and all the things that are fatal at level 1 become much less dangerous. 
But I think this is only possible if you can easily get lots of money, 
which means healers and archeologists. Or you have to the rob minetown 
stores. Personally I don't use the protection racket for 'normal' 
characters.

All in all, I think it's a valid strategy for some experienced players. 
Newer players shouldn't attempt it if they want to get far, but it can 
teach them about pet management and running away instead of fighting.

